</div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.4"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Local immediate consequence of the auxiliary representation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"209–211"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"233–235"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)\">\\(\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"226d4e217415a6b5\" href=\"?note=226d4e217415a6b5\" title=\"27-df-quadgraphrepr\">27-df-quadgraphrepr</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clique}(G_D)\">\\(\\mathrm{Clique}(G_D)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e2479a82c16206e\" href=\"?note=8e2479a82c16206e\" title=\"27-df-clique\">27-df-clique</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\binom C2\">\\(\\binom C2\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"87fcc2e909cc2731\" href=\"?note=87fcc2e909cc2731\" title=\"27-df-binom2\">27-df-binom2</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\;\\left(C\\in\\mathrm{Clique}(G_D)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\binom C2\\;\\exists T\\in D\\;(\\mathrm{Lits}(T)=L)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\;\\left(C\\in\\mathrm{Clique}(G_D)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\binom C2\\;\\exists T\\in D\\;(\\mathrm{Lits}(T)=L)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地展开式：逐对顶点为边，与每个二元文字子集对应项出现在 D 中，是同一个条件。原书并未声称 arbitrary quadratic function 的 prime implicants 是该辅助图的 maximal cliques；这里也没有这种推断。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadgraphrepr","status":"resolved","id":"226d4e217415a6b5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadgraphrepr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clique","status":"resolved","id":"8e2479a82c16206e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-clique]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-binom2","status":"resolved","id":"87fcc2e909cc2731","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-binom2]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadgraphrepr","status":"resolved","id":"226d4e217415a6b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits}$ 和 $\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)$（see [[27-df-quadgraphrepr]]）；$\\mathrm{Clique}(G_D)$（see [[27-df-clique]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clique","status":"resolved","id":"8e2479a82c16206e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{Lits}$ 和 $\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)$（see 